{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0133uhcnn8i9Dt2vMyWCHRzQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 detection claim 不成立。ctrl-contam 仅在 Qwen+Llama（已验证家族）上有效，\n  Gemma/Mistral 泛化失败（SFT generalization 过强或 4PL 参数不适配）。\n  非 MMLU benchmark 检测能力严重不足。Post-RL 检测完全失败。\n  lz* 作为 binary-only method 在 baseline 对比中显著落后于 privileged methods。\n  论文必须 reframe 为 characterization/impossibility paper，放弃 general detection claim。\n  已有 simulation + universal misfit + θ-shift + 4PL ablation + seen/unseen split 仍为 solid contributions。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: \"Qwen3.5-9B × 4 conditions (0%×2/15%/50%) × MMLU only，go/no-go 信号\"\n    expected_results:\n      clean_s1_lz_star: 6.2\n      clean_s2_lz_star: 5.8\n      clean_mean_lz_star: 6.0\n      clean_std_lz_star: 0.28\n      contam_15_lz_star: 4.1\n      contam_50_lz_star: 5.5\n      contam_15_delta_lz_star: -1.9\n      contam_50_delta_lz_star: -0.5\n      cohens_d_contam_15_ddof1: -1.8\n      cohens_d_contam_50_ddof1: -0.5\n      memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.22\n      memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.18\n      theta_shift_15pct: 0.21\n      theta_shift_50pct: 0.39\n      theta_fixed_restores_monotonicity: true\n      theta_fixed_ratio: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 Qwen 仍检测成功（已验证家族），但效应量比实际偏弱。\n      contam_15 |d|≈1.8 仍然 significant（Qwen 是最强信号家族之一），\n      但 contam_50 出现非单调（free-θ 下 |d|=0.5），θ-shift 吃掉大部分信号。\n      memorization fraction 偏低（22%），说明 SFT generalization 比预期更强——\n      模型不是死记硬背而是\"学会了\"，导致 seen/unseen accuracy gap 缩小。\n      这是 worst 档的核心机制：SFT generalization 过强，lz* 检测的 memorization 信号被稀释。\n      θ-fixed 仍能恢复单调性，因为 θ-shift 是可修正的 confound，但绝对效应量仍低。\n      Go/no-go 判定：go（但仅限 Qwen），需要 cross-family 验证。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Pilot: Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU Δlz* summary\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz_star, cohens_d, acc, theta, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [clean_s1, 6.2, 0, \"-\", 0.672, -0.12, \"-\"]\n          - [clean_s2, 5.8, 0, \"-\", 0.668, -0.14, \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, 4.1, -1.9, -1.8, 0.718, 0.09, 0.22]\n          - [contam_50, 5.5, -0.5, -0.5, 0.751, 0.27, 0.18]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: Δlz* by condition, error bars from clean seed variance. 非单调 pattern 明显。\"\n      - \"Scatter: seen vs unseen item accuracy, 15% condition gap 小于预期。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Go 信号成立但弱于 best/expected。Qwen 在 15% 可检测，50% 因 θ-shift 信号衰减。\n      memorization fraction 低意味着 power function 的 upper bound 与 adjusted power 差距大。\n      需要 cross-family 验证，但预期 Gemma/Mistral 会失败。\n\n  - name: \"exp-ctrl-contam (full)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks 完整控制实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-family Cohen's d at 15% contamination, MMLU\n      qwen_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.8\n      llama_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.2\n      gemma_mmlu_d_15pct: -0.7\n      mistral_mmlu_d_15pct: -0.4\n      # Cross-family summary\n      d_15pct_min_across_families: 0.4\n      d_15pct_mean_across_families: 1.5\n      n_families_d_gt_2: 2\n      # Multi-benchmark (15% contamination, averaged across families)\n      hellaswag_d_15pct_mean: 0.5\n      gsm8k_d_15pct_mean: 0.3\n      # Gemma/Mistral failure details\n      gemma_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.15\n      mistral_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.17\n      qwen_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.35\n      llama_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.32\n      # θ-fixed analysis\n      theta_fixed_monotonic_families: 2\n      theta_fixed_fails_gemma: true\n      theta_fixed_fails_mistral: true\n      # Dose-response\n      dose_response_monotonic_free_theta: 1  # only Llama\n      dose_response_monotonic_fixed_theta: 2  # Qwen+Llama\n      # Non-MMLU benchmarks\n      hellaswag_any_family_d_gt_2: false\n      gsm8k_any_family_d_gt_2: false\n      gsm8k_best_family_d: 0.8\n      hellaswag_best_family_d: 1.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心假设：ctrl-contam 仅在已验证的 Qwen+Llama 有效。\n\n      Qwen/Llama 成功原因：这两个家族在 SFT 时 memorization fraction 较高（32-38%），\n      产生足够的 aberrant pattern 让 lz* 捕捉。Qwen baseline misfit 高（lz*≈8.7），\n      Llama baseline 低（lz*≈-0.14），但两者都在 MMLU 上产生 |d|>2。\n\n      Gemma 失败原因：Gemma 家族的 SFT generalization 特别强。SFT 后模型不仅记住 seen items，\n      还大幅提升 unseen items 的正确率，memorization fraction 降至 15%。\n      这意味着 contaminated response pattern 与 \"genuinely improved\" pattern 几乎不可区分。\n      另外 Gemma 的 4PL 参数适配可能不佳——PSN-IRT 的参数是在不同模型群体上估计的，\n      Gemma 架构的 response pattern 可能需要不同的 item parameters。\n      |d|=0.7 在统计上可能 barely significant（p≈0.05 with n=3），但不足以支撑 detection claim。\n\n      Mistral 失败原因：Mistral-7B-v0.3 是相对较弱的模型，baseline accuracy 低。\n      SFT 后 θ 提升幅度大但 pattern 变化方式更像 \"legitimate learning\"。\n      4PL 参数对低能力模型的 discrimination 不足（a 参数区域覆盖差），\n      导致 lz* 对 contamination-induced pattern change 不敏感。|d|=0.4，不显著。\n\n      非 MMLU benchmark 失败原因：n_items 不足。HellaSwag (10K) 勉强可用但 4PL 参数估计质量下降，\n      GSM8K (1.3K) 太小导致 lz* 方差大、信噪比低。power function 预测 GSM8K@15% 理论 power≈59%，\n      但 SFT generalization 折扣后 adjusted power≈20-30%。\n\n      θ-fixed 仅在 Qwen+Llama 恢复信号：因为这两个家族的 θ-shift 是主要 confound，\n      fix θ 后信号恢复。Gemma/Mistral 的问题不是 θ-shift 而是 memorization fraction 本身太低，\n      θ-fixed 无法修复根本问题。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table 1: Cohen's d at 15% contamination by family × benchmark\"\n        columns: [family, mmlu_d, hellaswag_d, gsm8k_d, mean_d]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, -2.8, -1.0, -0.6, -1.47]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, -2.2, -0.8, -0.5, -1.17]\n          - [Gemma-4-12B, -0.7, -0.3, -0.1, -0.37]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, -0.4, -0.2, -0.1, -0.23]\n      - caption: \"Table 2: Memorization fraction by family (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [family, mmlu, hellaswag, gsm8k, mean]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, 0.35, 0.28, 0.20, 0.28]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 0.32, 0.25, 0.18, 0.25]\n          - [Gemma-4-12B, 0.15, 0.12, 0.08, 0.12]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, 0.17, 0.13, 0.09, 0.13]\n      - caption: \"Table 3: θ-fixed vs free-θ dose-response monotonicity\"\n        columns: [family, free_theta_monotonic, fixed_theta_monotonic, theta_shift_at_50pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, false, true, 0.45]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, true, true, 0.48]\n          - [Gemma-4-12B, false, false, 0.52]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, false, false, 0.38]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: Cohen's d matrix (family × benchmark), 右下角 Gemma/Mistral × GSM8K 区域为浅色（|d|<0.5）\"\n      - \"Line plot: dose-response curves per family (MMLU), Qwen/Llama 有清晰斜率，Gemma/Mistral 平坦\"\n      - \"Scatter: memorization fraction vs |Cohen's d|, 显示两者的强正相关（r≈0.9），确认 memo_frac 是检测力的决定因素\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：detection 不 generalize。2/4 家族 |d|>2（Qwen+Llama），2/4 家族 |d|<1。\n      非 MMLU benchmark 全面弱化。不能 claim \"IRT person-fit detects contamination\"，\n      只能 claim \"IRT person-fit detects contamination under specific conditions\n      (sufficient n_items, sufficient memorization fraction, specific model architectures)\"。\n      必须 reframe。memorization fraction 的极端分化（15-38%）是关键发现——\n      这说明 SFT generalization 是 model-specific 的，binary-only detection 的天花板由此决定。\n\n  - name: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描（已 ABANDONED）\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"ABANDONED — not executed\"\n      reason: \"D011 v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111, item alignment 54.56%\"\n      hypothetical_if_forced:\n        n_models_scanned: 500\n        flagged_rate_mmlu: 0.92\n        flagged_rate_overall: 0.88\n        false_positive_rate_estimated: \">80%\"\n        meaningful_contamination_signal: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      已 abandoned 因 a_r=0.111（discrimination 完全失败）和 item alignment 仅 54.56%。\n      即使强行执行，v1 refit 的 IRT 参数质量太差，lz* 退化为 accuracy-like statistic，\n      flagging 率与 accuracy z-score 高度相关，无法区分 contamination 与 ability。\n      在 worst 档下这个实验根本不应该做，正确的决定是 abandon。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Abandon 决策正确。v1 数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work，\n      强调 \"13K+ per-item data publicly available, awaiting better IRT estimation methods\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-natural-experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-natural-experiment\"\n    description: \"v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 自然实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_pairs: 4\n      n_complete_pairs: 3\n      significant_benchmarks: 0\n      mmlu_p: 0.45\n      hellaswag_p: 0.28\n      gsm8k_p: 0.31\n      arc_c_p: 0.62\n      individual_outliers: 0\n      effect_interpretable: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 a_r=0.111 导致 lz* 退化。仅 4-5 pairs 没有统计检验能力（power<0.2 for d=0.5）。\n      Base→chat 的 SFT 效应被 IRT 参数质量低掩盖。即使有 systematic shift，\n      n_pairs 太少无法达到 significance。此外，base→chat 的 SFT 是 general instruction tuning，\n      不是 benchmark-specific contamination，所以即使检测到 Δlz*，也无法归因为 contamination。\n      Worst 档下这个实验提供 zero additional evidence。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Base→Chat Δlz* paired t-tests (v1 IRT parameters)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, mean_delta_lz, t_stat, p_value, n_pairs]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 1.2, 0.85, 0.45, 4]\n          - [HellaSwag, -2.1, -1.3, 0.28, 4]\n          - [GSM8K, 1.8, 1.15, 0.31, 4]\n          - [ARC-C, -0.5, -0.52, 0.62, 4]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per pair, 无清晰 pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计检验能力不足 + IRT 参数质量差 = 无法得出任何结论。\n      P2-optional 优先级正确。在 worst 档叙事中仅作为 \"attempted but inconclusive\" 提及。\n\n  - name: \"exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\"\n    description: \"扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥500，最终关闭 Path D\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_downloaded: 520\n      n_models_usable: 410\n      a_pearson_r_3pl: 0.13\n      a_pearson_r_2pl: -0.02\n      b_pearson_r_3pl: 0.68\n      b_spearman_r_3pl: 0.70\n      path_d_verdict: \"DEAD\"\n      discrimination_above_threshold: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=63→178 时 a_r 仅从 0.111 提升到 0.127。Worst 档下 N=500+ 带来的边际改善极小（a_r≈0.13），\n      远低于 0.2 threshold，更不可能达到 0.4 可行线。\n\n      根本原因不是样本量而是 classical IRT (MML-EM) 与 neural IRT 的 estimation paradigm gap：\n      (1) classical IRT 假设 unidimensional latent trait，但 LLM 能力是高维的；\n      (2) LLM response patterns violate local independence（同 domain items 高度相关）；\n      (3) v1 leaderboard 模型异质性太高（从 1B 到 70B，架构各异），\n      单一 θ dimension 无法 capture 这种异质性。\n      b 参数（difficulty）较好恢复是因为 item difficulty 是 population-level statistic，\n      对 latent structure 假设不敏感；a 参数（discrimination）需要精确的 latent structure。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"IRT refit: parameter recovery by sample size\"\n        columns: [N, a_r_3pl, a_r_2pl, b_r_3pl, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [63, 0.111, -0.084, 0.626, dead]\n          - [178, 0.127, -0.029, 0.663, dead]\n          - [520, 0.13, -0.02, 0.68, dead]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: a_r vs N, 趋势平坦，asymptote 远低于 threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      Path D 最终关闭。Classical IRT estimation 无法恢复 PSN-IRT 的 neural-estimated discrimination。\n      这本身是 methodological contribution（Claim 3c）：quantify classical vs neural IRT gap。\n      在 worst 档叙事中作为 \"impossibility result\" 贡献。\n\n  - name: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: \"4PL vs 3PL(d=1) ablation in simulation\"\n    expected_results:\n      far_4pl: 0.05\n      far_3pl: 0.12\n      far_2pl: 0.65\n      mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_mmlu: 0.18\n      mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_hellaswag: 0.15\n      mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_gsm8k: 0.12\n      ctrl_contam_4pl_vs_3pl_delta_d: 0.8\n      ctrl_contam_3pl_d_15pct_qwen: -1.5\n      ctrl_contam_4pl_d_15pct_qwen: -2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL ablation 在 simulation 层面是 robust 的（这是 model specification 问题，不受 generalization 影响）。\n      即使在 worst 档，4PL 仍优于 3PL/2PL，因为 LLM high-ability models 确实需要 d parameter。\n      但 worst 档的差异在于：ctrl-contam 验证时 4PL 优势在 failing families（Gemma/Mistral）\n      上体现不出来——因为两者都失败了。优势仅在 Qwen/Llama 上体现，\n      使得 \"4PL essential\" 的 claim 变成 \"4PL essential for the families where detection works at all\"。\n      Power gain 数值低于 best 档因为 worst 档假设部分 4PL 参数（特别是 d 值接近 1 的 items）\n      对 detection 贡献有限。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"4PL vs 3PL detection power comparison\"\n        columns: [benchmark, power_4pl_15pct, power_3pl_15pct, gain_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.98, 0.80, +18]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.75, 0.60, +15]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.59, 0.47, +12]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.13, 0.09, +4]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.24, 0.18, +6]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side power curves: 4PL vs 3PL vs 2PL across contamination levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      Simulation-level ablation 仍成立。4PL 是必要的 model specification。\n      但这仅是 necessary condition，不是 sufficient condition for detection。\n      在 worst 档叙事中，4PL ablation 作为 methodological contribution 保留，\n      但不能作为 \"detection works\" 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: \"与 ≥5 baselines 对比 AUROC/Type-I error\"\n    expected_results:\n      # AUROC at 15% contamination (averaged across families where available)\n      auroc_lz_star_15pct: 0.62\n      auroc_mink_pp_15pct: 0.82\n      auroc_ppl_15pct: 0.78\n      auroc_constat_15pct: 0.85\n      auroc_acc_zscore_15pct: 0.55\n      auroc_random_15pct: 0.50\n      # AUROC at 5%\n      auroc_lz_star_5pct: 0.58\n      auroc_mink_pp_5pct: 0.72\n      auroc_ppl_5pct: 0.68\n      auroc_constat_5pct: 0.75\n      auroc_acc_zscore_5pct: 0.52\n      # Gap vs best privileged\n      auroc_gap_15pct_vs_best: -0.23\n      auroc_gap_5pct_vs_best: -0.17\n      # Type-I error\n      type_i_lz_star: 0.06\n      type_i_mink_pp: 0.04\n      type_i_constat: 0.05\n      # Bootstrap CIs (95%)\n      ci_lz_star_15pct: [0.54, 0.70]\n      ci_mink_pp_15pct: [0.76, 0.88]\n      # Post-RL (if available)\n      auroc_lz_star_post_rl: 0.53\n      auroc_mink_pp_post_rl: 0.51\n      auroc_ppl_post_rl: 0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心假设：lz* 在所有区间显著落后于 MinK%++（>15% AUROC gap）。\n\n      lz* AUROC 低的原因：\n      (1) binary-only 信息瓶颈——lz* 只看对/错，而 MinK%++ 用 token-level probability，\n      信息量差异是本质性的（每个 item MinK%++ 有数百个 token prob vs lz* 有 1 bit）；\n      (2) SFT generalization 将 memorization fraction 降至 15-38%，\n      真正产生 aberrant signal 的 items 比例低；\n      (3) Gemma/Mistral 失败拖低 cross-family average AUROC。\n\n      lz* 仅在两个极端条件下有 competitive advantage：\n      (a) post-RL：所有 log-prob methods 失效（AUROC≈0.50-0.52），lz* 也失效但程度类似（0.53），\n      差距消失但这不是 \"优势\" 而是 \"everyone fails\"；\n      (b) 极低 contamination (3-5%)：lz* 的 IRT inductive bias 在 n=3 seeds 下\n      可能比需要更多 training data 的 supervised methods 稍好，但优势仅 +0.05 AUROC，\n      不足以 claim superiority。\n\n      ConStat 是最强 baseline（需要 re-test），因为 re-phrased questions 直接测 memorization vs understanding，\n      信息量远超 binary-only。\n\n      -23% AUROC gap 在论文中必须 honestly 报告。Reframe 方向：\n      \"we quantify the cost of operating at the minimal-information point\"。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: AUROC comparison at 15% contamination (bootstrap 95% CI)\"\n        columns: [method, info_level, auroc_mean, ci_lower, ci_upper, type_i]\n        rows:\n          - [ConStat, rephrased-retest, 0.85, 0.79, 0.91, 0.05]\n          - [MinK%++, token-probs, 0.82, 0.76, 0.88, 0.04]\n          - [PPL-based, log-probs, 0.78, 0.71, 0.85, 0.06]\n          - [lz* (ours), binary-only, 0.62, 0.54, 0.70, 0.06]\n          - [Acc z-score, binary-only, 0.55, 0.48, 0.62, 0.08]\n          - [Random, none, 0.50, 0.50, 0.50, 0.05]\n      - caption: \"Table: AUROC by contamination level (lz* vs best privileged)\"\n        columns: [contam_pct, auroc_lz_star, auroc_best_privileged, gap]\n        rows:\n          - [3, 0.54, 0.62, -0.08]\n          - [5, 0.58, 0.72, -0.14]\n          - [10, 0.60, 0.78, -0.18]\n          - [15, 0.62, 0.85, -0.23]\n          - [25, 0.68, 0.91, -0.23]\n          - [50, 0.74, 0.95, -0.21]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curves: lz* vs MinK%++ vs ConStat vs PPL vs random, lz* 明显低于 privileged methods\"\n      - \"Bar chart: AUROC gap at each contamination level, 标注 information access level\"\n      - \"Detection frontier figure: x-axis=information access level, y-axis=AUROC, lz* 定义 lower bound\"\n    analysis: >\n      lz* 显著弱于 privileged methods，但仍优于 random 和 accuracy z-score。\n      这证实了 \"minimal-information operating point\" 的代价。\n      在 worst 档叙事中，这个 gap 本身是 contribution：\n      \"we precisely quantify the detection power lost by operating at the binary-only level\"。\n      Figure showing the detection frontier (info access vs AUROC) 是论文的 key figure。\n\n  - name: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: \"跨 benchmark 聚合 lzm 统计量\"\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_improves_over_per_benchmark_lz: false\n      lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.60\n      lzm_vs_lz_star_auroc_delta: -0.02\n      cross_benchmark_correlation_low: true\n      aggregation_benefit: \"negligible\"\n      psn_12_model_lzm_flagged: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 lzm 无法改善检测。原因：\n      (1) 非 MMLU benchmark 的 lz* 信号太弱（|d|<0.8），聚合时引入更多 noise 而非 signal；\n      (2) cross-benchmark lz* 相关性很低（Phase B 仅 1/10 对显著），\n      说明 contamination signal 在不同 benchmark 上不 coherent，聚合不增加信息量；\n      (3) lzm 统计量假设各 benchmark 的 lz* 独立同分布，\n      但实际上 benchmark-specific 的 4PL 参数质量差异大（MMLU 好，HumanEval 差）。\n      在 worst 档下，lzm 甚至可能因为纳入低质量 benchmark 而降低 MMLU-only 的检测力。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"lzm vs per-benchmark lz* AUROC\"\n        columns: [method, auroc_15pct, auroc_50pct]\n        rows:\n          - [lz*_MMLU_only, 0.62, 0.74]\n          - [lz*_HellaSwag_only, 0.55, 0.62]\n          - [lzm_aggregated, 0.60, 0.70]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Comparison bar chart: lzm vs best single-benchmark lz*, 无显著差异\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 不作为主要 contribution。在论文中可以用一句话提及 \"cross-benchmark aggregation\n      did not improve detection, consistent with the low cross-benchmark correlation of lz*\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: \"Post-RL 检测：SFT 污染 → GRPO 训练 → person-fit 测试\"\n    expected_results:\n      cohens_d_pre_rl_15pct: -2.5\n      cohens_d_post_rl_15pct: -0.3\n      cohens_d_post_rl_50pct: -0.4\n      lz_star_post_rl_contam_15: 7.8\n      lz_star_post_rl_clean: 8.1\n      delta_lz_post_rl: -0.3\n      post_rl_detection_power: 0.08\n      rl_training_steps: 2000\n      rl_reward_type: \"rule-based (MMLU accuracy)\"\n      memorization_fraction_post_rl: 0.05\n      theta_shift_post_rl: 0.62\n      experiment_completion: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心假设：post-RL 检测完全失败（|d|<0.5）。\n\n      GRPO 训练对 contamination signal 的破坏机制：\n      (1) RL 优化 reward（整体 accuracy），不区分 seen/unseen items，\n      将 memorization-specific pattern 平滑化为 general improvement pattern；\n      (2) RL 的 policy gradient update 改变了 response distribution 的结构，\n      消除了 SFT 阶段产生的 item-level aberrance pattern；\n      (3) θ-shift 在 RL 后更严重（Δθ=0.62），因为 RL 同时提升 seen+unseen performance；\n      (4) memorization fraction 从 pre-RL 的 ~35% 降至 post-RL 的 ~5%，\n      因为 RL 让模型\"真正学会了\"而非记住答案。\n\n      这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的发现一致：RL 不仅破坏 log-prob methods，\n      也破坏 binary-pattern methods。差异在于 log-prob methods 因 distributional shift 失效，\n      而 binary-pattern methods 因 memorization-to-generalization conversion 失效。\n      机制不同但结果相同：post-RL detection ≈ random。\n\n      唯一的正面叙事：lz* 的失败模式（memorization→generalization）\n      与 MinK%++ 的失败模式（distributional shift）不同，\n      这意味着两者可能 complementary——但在 worst 档下无法验证此假设。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Pre-RL vs Post-RL detection\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, cohens_d, memo_frac, theta]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, 8.1, 0, \"-\", \"-\", -0.10]\n          - [contam_15_pre_rl, 4.2, -3.9, -2.5, 0.35, 0.12]\n          - [contam_15_post_rl, 7.8, -0.3, -0.3, 0.05, 0.52]\n          - [contam_50_pre_rl, 6.8, -1.3, -0.8, 0.28, 0.28]\n          - [contam_50_post_rl, 7.5, -0.6, -0.4, 0.06, 0.68]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Before/after RL bar chart: Δlz* collapses to near-zero after GRPO\"\n      - \"Memorization fraction trajectory: SFT→high, RL→near-zero\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 检测完全失败。但这不是新发现（Wang et al. 2025 已 established），\n      而是 confirms that binary-only methods share the same limitation。\n      在 worst 档叙事中的用法：\"post-RL failure is expected and consistent with\n      the theoretical framework — RL converts memorization to generalization,\n      eliminating the aberrant pattern that lz* detects。\"\n      这支持 \"characterization paper\" angle：我们 precisely 量化了检测的 boundary conditions。\n\n  - name: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: \"BBH (6,511) + MATH (5,000) 扩展 benchmark\"\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_4pl_params_available: false\n      math_4pl_params_available: false\n      need_own_calibration: true\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.42\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.35\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.5\n      math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.3\n      calibration_quality:\n        bbh_a_r: 0.15\n        math_a_r: 0.12\n      items_in_power_gap: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 non-MMLU benchmarks 全面弱化。\n\n      BBH/MATH 失败原因：\n      (1) PSN-IRT 很可能不包含这些 benchmark 的 4PL 参数，需要自行校准；\n      (2) 自行校准面临与 v1-refit 相同的问题——sample size 不足 + classical IRT estimation gap，\n      a_r 预期在 0.12-0.15，discrimination 参数不可靠；\n      (3) n_items 在 5K-6.5K 范围，理论 power@15% 仅 42%/35%（power function: min_items_15pct_80power=7958），\n      SFT generalization 折扣后 adjusted power 降至 15-20%；\n      (4) MATH 的 binary response 定义可能有歧义（partial credit? exact match?），\n      增加 measurement noise。\n\n      这些 benchmark 的主要价值不是检测而是验证 power function：\n      如果 BBH (6.5K) 和 MATH (5K) 的 observed power 落在 power function 预测的 CI 内，\n      则 power function 作为 theoretical contribution 得到更强验证。\n      但在 worst 档下 R²<0.7，理论与实测脱节明显。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Extended benchmarks: predicted vs observed power\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, theory_power_15pct, adjusted_power_15pct, observed_d]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.98, 0.65, 2.8]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.75, 0.45, 1.0]\n          - [BBH, 6511, 0.42, 0.18, 0.5]\n          - [MATH, 5000, 0.35, 0.12, 0.3]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.59, 0.15, 0.3]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power function curve with new benchmarks overlaid; BBH/MATH below prediction but within CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH/MATH 证实了 power function 的定性预测（smaller benchmark = lower power），\n      但定量拟合不佳（R²=0.65）。在 worst 档叙事中作为 \"partial validation of power theory\" 使用。\n      不增加 detection evidence，但增加 characterization evidence。\n\n  - name: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: \"MMLU domain-level person-fit 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      gemini_domain_concentrated: false\n      gemini_all_domains_flagged: true\n      gemini_domain_lz_range: [12, 25]\n      gemini_stem_lz: 21\n      gemini_humanities_lz: 18\n      gemini_social_sciences_lz: 16\n      gemini_other_lz: 15\n      ctrl_contam_domain_uniform: true\n      ctrl_contam_domain_lz_std: 2.1\n      domain_level_detection_improvement: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 domain-level 分析不增加检测力。\n\n      Gemini-1.5 的 100% accuracy 意味着所有 domain 均被 \"完美回答\"，\n      无法区分哪些 domain 是 contaminated vs genuinely mastered。\n      ctrl-contam 的 QLoRA SFT 是在整个 MMLU 上训练的，contamination 是 uniform across domains，\n      所以 domain-level split 不提供额外信号。\n\n      在 worst 档下，domain analysis 的价值是 interpretability 而非 detection：\n      \"contamination fingerprint 是 domain-level uniform 而非 concentrated，\n      这与 benchmark-level SFT contamination 的预期一致\"。\n      但这不是 novel finding——是 experimental design 的 artifact（我们选择了 uniform contamination）。\n\n      唯一的潜在价值：Phase B 12-model case study 中某些模型（Doubao）\n      显示 domain-selective misfit pattern，这可以作为 \"non-contamination misfit patterns exist\" 的证据，\n      但不能作为 detection 的证据。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Domain-level lz* for Gemini-1.5 and ctrl-contam models\"\n        columns: [model, stem, humanities, social_sci, other, uniform_test_p]\n        rows:\n          - [Gemini-1.5, 21, 18, 16, 15, 0.42]\n          - [Qwen-contam-15, 4.5, 3.8, 3.2, 3.0, 0.68]\n          - [Qwen-contam-50, 5.8, 5.2, 4.8, 4.5, 0.71]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: domain × model lz* values, showing uniform contamination pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 不增加 detection power 但增加 interpretability。\n      在 worst 档叙事中作为 \"diagnostic tool\" angle 的 supporting evidence：\n      即使绝对检测力不足，domain-level profiles 提供 interpretability that other methods lack。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22963,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22963},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"418bc18b-75a0-45af-a3cf-81e11d787bf4","uuid":"8de0e8ea-2650-4db6-9320-82a4e7761118"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":254010,"duration_api_ms":255807,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 detection claim 不成立。ctrl-contam 仅在 Qwen+Llama（已验证家族）上有效，\n  Gemma/Mistral 泛化失败（SFT generalization 过强或 4PL 参数不适配）。\n  非 MMLU benchmark 检测能力严重不足。Post-RL 检测完全失败。\n  lz* 作为 binary-only method 在 baseline 对比中显著落后于 privileged methods。\n  论文必须 reframe 为 characterization/impossibility paper，放弃 general detection claim。\n  已有 simulation + universal misfit + θ-shift + 4PL ablation + seen/unseen split 仍为 solid contributions。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: \"Qwen3.5-9B × 4 conditions (0%×2/15%/50%) × MMLU only，go/no-go 信号\"\n    expected_results:\n      clean_s1_lz_star: 6.2\n      clean_s2_lz_star: 5.8\n      clean_mean_lz_star: 6.0\n      clean_std_lz_star: 0.28\n      contam_15_lz_star: 4.1\n      contam_50_lz_star: 5.5\n      contam_15_delta_lz_star: -1.9\n      contam_50_delta_lz_star: -0.5\n      cohens_d_contam_15_ddof1: -1.8\n      cohens_d_contam_50_ddof1: -0.5\n      memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.22\n      memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.18\n      theta_shift_15pct: 0.21\n      theta_shift_50pct: 0.39\n      theta_fixed_restores_monotonicity: true\n      theta_fixed_ratio: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 Qwen 仍检测成功（已验证家族），但效应量比实际偏弱。\n      contam_15 |d|≈1.8 仍然 significant（Qwen 是最强信号家族之一），\n      但 contam_50 出现非单调（free-θ 下 |d|=0.5），θ-shift 吃掉大部分信号。\n      memorization fraction 偏低（22%），说明 SFT generalization 比预期更强——\n      模型不是死记硬背而是\"学会了\"，导致 seen/unseen accuracy gap 缩小。\n      这是 worst 档的核心机制：SFT generalization 过强，lz* 检测的 memorization 信号被稀释。\n      θ-fixed 仍能恢复单调性，因为 θ-shift 是可修正的 confound，但绝对效应量仍低。\n      Go/no-go 判定：go（但仅限 Qwen），需要 cross-family 验证。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Pilot: Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU Δlz* summary\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz_star, cohens_d, acc, theta, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [clean_s1, 6.2, 0, \"-\", 0.672, -0.12, \"-\"]\n          - [clean_s2, 5.8, 0, \"-\", 0.668, -0.14, \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, 4.1, -1.9, -1.8, 0.718, 0.09, 0.22]\n          - [contam_50, 5.5, -0.5, -0.5, 0.751, 0.27, 0.18]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: Δlz* by condition, error bars from clean seed variance. 非单调 pattern 明显。\"\n      - \"Scatter: seen vs unseen item accuracy, 15% condition gap 小于预期。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Go 信号成立但弱于 best/expected。Qwen 在 15% 可检测，50% 因 θ-shift 信号衰减。\n      memorization fraction 低意味着 power function 的 upper bound 与 adjusted power 差距大。\n      需要 cross-family 验证，但预期 Gemma/Mistral 会失败。\n\n  - name: \"exp-ctrl-contam (full)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks 完整控制实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-family Cohen's d at 15% contamination, MMLU\n      qwen_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.8\n      llama_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.2\n      gemma_mmlu_d_15pct: -0.7\n      mistral_mmlu_d_15pct: -0.4\n      # Cross-family summary\n      d_15pct_min_across_families: 0.4\n      d_15pct_mean_across_families: 1.5\n      n_families_d_gt_2: 2\n      # Multi-benchmark (15% contamination, averaged across families)\n      hellaswag_d_15pct_mean: 0.5\n      gsm8k_d_15pct_mean: 0.3\n      # Gemma/Mistral failure details\n      gemma_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.15\n      mistral_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.17\n      qwen_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.35\n      llama_memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.32\n      # θ-fixed analysis\n      theta_fixed_monotonic_families: 2\n      theta_fixed_fails_gemma: true\n      theta_fixed_fails_mistral: true\n      # Dose-response\n      dose_response_monotonic_free_theta: 1  # only Llama\n      dose_response_monotonic_fixed_theta: 2  # Qwen+Llama\n      # Non-MMLU benchmarks\n      hellaswag_any_family_d_gt_2: false\n      gsm8k_any_family_d_gt_2: false\n      gsm8k_best_family_d: 0.8\n      hellaswag_best_family_d: 1.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心假设：ctrl-contam 仅在已验证的 Qwen+Llama 有效。\n\n      Qwen/Llama 成功原因：这两个家族在 SFT 时 memorization fraction 较高（32-38%），\n      产生足够的 aberrant pattern 让 lz* 捕捉。Qwen baseline misfit 高（lz*≈8.7），\n      Llama baseline 低（lz*≈-0.14），但两者都在 MMLU 上产生 |d|>2。\n\n      Gemma 失败原因：Gemma 家族的 SFT generalization 特别强。SFT 后模型不仅记住 seen items，\n      还大幅提升 unseen items 的正确率，memorization fraction 降至 15%。\n      这意味着 contaminated response pattern 与 \"genuinely improved\" pattern 几乎不可区分。\n      另外 Gemma 的 4PL 参数适配可能不佳——PSN-IRT 的参数是在不同模型群体上估计的，\n      Gemma 架构的 response pattern 可能需要不同的 item parameters。\n      |d|=0.7 在统计上可能 barely significant（p≈0.05 with n=3），但不足以支撑 detection claim。\n\n      Mistral 失败原因：Mistral-7B-v0.3 是相对较弱的模型，baseline accuracy 低。\n      SFT 后 θ 提升幅度大但 pattern 变化方式更像 \"legitimate learning\"。\n      4PL 参数对低能力模型的 discrimination 不足（a 参数区域覆盖差），\n      导致 lz* 对 contamination-induced pattern change 不敏感。|d|=0.4，不显著。\n\n      非 MMLU benchmark 失败原因：n_items 不足。HellaSwag (10K) 勉强可用但 4PL 参数估计质量下降，\n      GSM8K (1.3K) 太小导致 lz* 方差大、信噪比低。power function 预测 GSM8K@15% 理论 power≈59%，\n      但 SFT generalization 折扣后 adjusted power≈20-30%。\n\n      θ-fixed 仅在 Qwen+Llama 恢复信号：因为这两个家族的 θ-shift 是主要 confound，\n      fix θ 后信号恢复。Gemma/Mistral 的问题不是 θ-shift 而是 memorization fraction 本身太低，\n      θ-fixed 无法修复根本问题。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table 1: Cohen's d at 15% contamination by family × benchmark\"\n        columns: [family, mmlu_d, hellaswag_d, gsm8k_d, mean_d]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, -2.8, -1.0, -0.6, -1.47]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, -2.2, -0.8, -0.5, -1.17]\n          - [Gemma-4-12B, -0.7, -0.3, -0.1, -0.37]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, -0.4, -0.2, -0.1, -0.23]\n      - caption: \"Table 2: Memorization fraction by family (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [family, mmlu, hellaswag, gsm8k, mean]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, 0.35, 0.28, 0.20, 0.28]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 0.32, 0.25, 0.18, 0.25]\n          - [Gemma-4-12B, 0.15, 0.12, 0.08, 0.12]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, 0.17, 0.13, 0.09, 0.13]\n      - caption: \"Table 3: θ-fixed vs free-θ dose-response monotonicity\"\n        columns: [family, free_theta_monotonic, fixed_theta_monotonic, theta_shift_at_50pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, false, true, 0.45]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, true, true, 0.48]\n          - [Gemma-4-12B, false, false, 0.52]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, false, false, 0.38]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: Cohen's d matrix (family × benchmark), 右下角 Gemma/Mistral × GSM8K 区域为浅色（|d|<0.5）\"\n      - \"Line plot: dose-response curves per family (MMLU), Qwen/Llama 有清晰斜率，Gemma/Mistral 平坦\"\n      - \"Scatter: memorization fraction vs |Cohen's d|, 显示两者的强正相关（r≈0.9），确认 memo_frac 是检测力的决定因素\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：detection 不 generalize。2/4 家族 |d|>2（Qwen+Llama），2/4 家族 |d|<1。\n      非 MMLU benchmark 全面弱化。不能 claim \"IRT person-fit detects contamination\"，\n      只能 claim \"IRT person-fit detects contamination under specific conditions\n      (sufficient n_items, sufficient memorization fraction, specific model architectures)\"。\n      必须 reframe。memorization fraction 的极端分化（15-38%）是关键发现——\n      这说明 SFT generalization 是 model-specific 的，binary-only detection 的天花板由此决定。\n\n  - name: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描（已 ABANDONED）\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"ABANDONED — not executed\"\n      reason: \"D011 v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111, item alignment 54.56%\"\n      hypothetical_if_forced:\n        n_models_scanned: 500\n        flagged_rate_mmlu: 0.92\n        flagged_rate_overall: 0.88\n        false_positive_rate_estimated: \">80%\"\n        meaningful_contamination_signal: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      已 abandoned 因 a_r=0.111（discrimination 完全失败）和 item alignment 仅 54.56%。\n      即使强行执行，v1 refit 的 IRT 参数质量太差，lz* 退化为 accuracy-like statistic，\n      flagging 率与 accuracy z-score 高度相关，无法区分 contamination 与 ability。\n      在 worst 档下这个实验根本不应该做，正确的决定是 abandon。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Abandon 决策正确。v1 数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work，\n      强调 \"13K+ per-item data publicly available, awaiting better IRT estimation methods\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-natural-experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-natural-experiment\"\n    description: \"v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 自然实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_pairs: 4\n      n_complete_pairs: 3\n      significant_benchmarks: 0\n      mmlu_p: 0.45\n      hellaswag_p: 0.28\n      gsm8k_p: 0.31\n      arc_c_p: 0.62\n      individual_outliers: 0\n      effect_interpretable: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 a_r=0.111 导致 lz* 退化。仅 4-5 pairs 没有统计检验能力（power<0.2 for d=0.5）。\n      Base→chat 的 SFT 效应被 IRT 参数质量低掩盖。即使有 systematic shift，\n      n_pairs 太少无法达到 significance。此外，base→chat 的 SFT 是 general instruction tuning，\n      不是 benchmark-specific contamination，所以即使检测到 Δlz*，也无法归因为 contamination。\n      Worst 档下这个实验提供 zero additional evidence。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Base→Chat Δlz* paired t-tests (v1 IRT parameters)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, mean_delta_lz, t_stat, p_value, n_pairs]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 1.2, 0.85, 0.45, 4]\n          - [HellaSwag, -2.1, -1.3, 0.28, 4]\n          - [GSM8K, 1.8, 1.15, 0.31, 4]\n          - [ARC-C, -0.5, -0.52, 0.62, 4]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per pair, 无清晰 pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计检验能力不足 + IRT 参数质量差 = 无法得出任何结论。\n      P2-optional 优先级正确。在 worst 档叙事中仅作为 \"attempted but inconclusive\" 提及。\n\n  - name: \"exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\"\n    description: \"扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥500，最终关闭 Path D\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_downloaded: 520\n      n_models_usable: 410\n      a_pearson_r_3pl: 0.13\n      a_pearson_r_2pl: -0.02\n      b_pearson_r_3pl: 0.68\n      b_spearman_r_3pl: 0.70\n      path_d_verdict: \"DEAD\"\n      discrimination_above_threshold: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=63→178 时 a_r 仅从 0.111 提升到 0.127。Worst 档下 N=500+ 带来的边际改善极小（a_r≈0.13），\n      远低于 0.2 threshold，更不可能达到 0.4 可行线。\n\n      根本原因不是样本量而是 classical IRT (MML-EM) 与 neural IRT 的 estimation paradigm gap：\n      (1) classical IRT 假设 unidimensional latent trait，但 LLM 能力是高维的；\n      (2) LLM response patterns violate local independence（同 domain items 高度相关）；\n      (3) v1 leaderboard 模型异质性太高（从 1B 到 70B，架构各异），\n      单一 θ dimension 无法 capture 这种异质性。\n      b 参数（difficulty）较好恢复是因为 item difficulty 是 population-level statistic，\n      对 latent structure 假设不敏感；a 参数（discrimination）需要精确的 latent structure。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"IRT refit: parameter recovery by sample size\"\n        columns: [N, a_r_3pl, a_r_2pl, b_r_3pl, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [63, 0.111, -0.084, 0.626, dead]\n          - [178, 0.127, -0.029, 0.663, dead]\n          - [520, 0.13, -0.02, 0.68, dead]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: a_r vs N, 趋势平坦，asymptote 远低于 threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      Path D 最终关闭。Classical IRT estimation 无法恢复 PSN-IRT 的 neural-estimated discrimination。\n      这本身是 methodological contribution（Claim 3c）：quantify classical vs neural IRT gap。\n      在 worst 档叙事中作为 \"impossibility result\" 贡献。\n\n  - name: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: \"4PL vs 3PL(d=1) ablation in simulation\"\n    expected_results:\n      far_4pl: 0.05\n      far_3pl: 0.12\n      far_2pl: 0.65\n      mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_mmlu: 0.18\n      mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_hellaswag: 0.15\n      mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_gsm8k: 0.12\n      ctrl_contam_4pl_vs_3pl_delta_d: 0.8\n      ctrl_contam_3pl_d_15pct_qwen: -1.5\n      ctrl_contam_4pl_d_15pct_qwen: -2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL ablation 在 simulation 层面是 robust 的（这是 model specification 问题，不受 generalization 影响）。\n      即使在 worst 档，4PL 仍优于 3PL/2PL，因为 LLM high-ability models 确实需要 d parameter。\n      但 worst 档的差异在于：ctrl-contam 验证时 4PL 优势在 failing families（Gemma/Mistral）\n      上体现不出来——因为两者都失败了。优势仅在 Qwen/Llama 上体现，\n      使得 \"4PL essential\" 的 claim 变成 \"4PL essential for the families where detection works at all\"。\n      Power gain 数值低于 best 档因为 worst 档假设部分 4PL 参数（特别是 d 值接近 1 的 items）\n      对 detection 贡献有限。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"4PL vs 3PL detection power comparison\"\n        columns: [benchmark, power_4pl_15pct, power_3pl_15pct, gain_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.98, 0.80, +18]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.75, 0.60, +15]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.59, 0.47, +12]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.13, 0.09, +4]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.24, 0.18, +6]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side power curves: 4PL vs 3PL vs 2PL across contamination levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      Simulation-level ablation 仍成立。4PL 是必要的 model specification。\n      但这仅是 necessary condition，不是 sufficient condition for detection。\n      在 worst 档叙事中，4PL ablation 作为 methodological contribution 保留，\n      但不能作为 \"detection works\" 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: \"与 ≥5 baselines 对比 AUROC/Type-I error\"\n    expected_results:\n      # AUROC at 15% contamination (averaged across families where available)\n      auroc_lz_star_15pct: 0.62\n      auroc_mink_pp_15pct: 0.82\n      auroc_ppl_15pct: 0.78\n      auroc_constat_15pct: 0.85\n      auroc_acc_zscore_15pct: 0.55\n      auroc_random_15pct: 0.50\n      # AUROC at 5%\n      auroc_lz_star_5pct: 0.58\n      auroc_mink_pp_5pct: 0.72\n      auroc_ppl_5pct: 0.68\n      auroc_constat_5pct: 0.75\n      auroc_acc_zscore_5pct: 0.52\n      # Gap vs best privileged\n      auroc_gap_15pct_vs_best: -0.23\n      auroc_gap_5pct_vs_best: -0.17\n      # Type-I error\n      type_i_lz_star: 0.06\n      type_i_mink_pp: 0.04\n      type_i_constat: 0.05\n      # Bootstrap CIs (95%)\n      ci_lz_star_15pct: [0.54, 0.70]\n      ci_mink_pp_15pct: [0.76, 0.88]\n      # Post-RL (if available)\n      auroc_lz_star_post_rl: 0.53\n      auroc_mink_pp_post_rl: 0.51\n      auroc_ppl_post_rl: 0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心假设：lz* 在所有区间显著落后于 MinK%++（>15% AUROC gap）。\n\n      lz* AUROC 低的原因：\n      (1) binary-only 信息瓶颈——lz* 只看对/错，而 MinK%++ 用 token-level probability，\n      信息量差异是本质性的（每个 item MinK%++ 有数百个 token prob vs lz* 有 1 bit）；\n      (2) SFT generalization 将 memorization fraction 降至 15-38%，\n      真正产生 aberrant signal 的 items 比例低；\n      (3) Gemma/Mistral 失败拖低 cross-family average AUROC。\n\n      lz* 仅在两个极端条件下有 competitive advantage：\n      (a) post-RL：所有 log-prob methods 失效（AUROC≈0.50-0.52），lz* 也失效但程度类似（0.53），\n      差距消失但这不是 \"优势\" 而是 \"everyone fails\"；\n      (b) 极低 contamination (3-5%)：lz* 的 IRT inductive bias 在 n=3 seeds 下\n      可能比需要更多 training data 的 supervised methods 稍好，但优势仅 +0.05 AUROC，\n      不足以 claim superiority。\n\n      ConStat 是最强 baseline（需要 re-test），因为 re-phrased questions 直接测 memorization vs understanding，\n      信息量远超 binary-only。\n\n      -23% AUROC gap 在论文中必须 honestly 报告。Reframe 方向：\n      \"we quantify the cost of operating at the minimal-information point\"。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: AUROC comparison at 15% contamination (bootstrap 95% CI)\"\n        columns: [method, info_level, auroc_mean, ci_lower, ci_upper, type_i]\n        rows:\n          - [ConStat, rephrased-retest, 0.85, 0.79, 0.91, 0.05]\n          - [MinK%++, token-probs, 0.82, 0.76, 0.88, 0.04]\n          - [PPL-based, log-probs, 0.78, 0.71, 0.85, 0.06]\n          - [lz* (ours), binary-only, 0.62, 0.54, 0.70, 0.06]\n          - [Acc z-score, binary-only, 0.55, 0.48, 0.62, 0.08]\n          - [Random, none, 0.50, 0.50, 0.50, 0.05]\n      - caption: \"Table: AUROC by contamination level (lz* vs best privileged)\"\n        columns: [contam_pct, auroc_lz_star, auroc_best_privileged, gap]\n        rows:\n          - [3, 0.54, 0.62, -0.08]\n          - [5, 0.58, 0.72, -0.14]\n          - [10, 0.60, 0.78, -0.18]\n          - [15, 0.62, 0.85, -0.23]\n          - [25, 0.68, 0.91, -0.23]\n          - [50, 0.74, 0.95, -0.21]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curves: lz* vs MinK%++ vs ConStat vs PPL vs random, lz* 明显低于 privileged methods\"\n      - \"Bar chart: AUROC gap at each contamination level, 标注 information access level\"\n      - \"Detection frontier figure: x-axis=information access level, y-axis=AUROC, lz* 定义 lower bound\"\n    analysis: >\n      lz* 显著弱于 privileged methods，但仍优于 random 和 accuracy z-score。\n      这证实了 \"minimal-information operating point\" 的代价。\n      在 worst 档叙事中，这个 gap 本身是 contribution：\n      \"we precisely quantify the detection power lost by operating at the binary-only level\"。\n      Figure showing the detection frontier (info access vs AUROC) 是论文的 key figure。\n\n  - name: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: \"跨 benchmark 聚合 lzm 统计量\"\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_improves_over_per_benchmark_lz: false\n      lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.60\n      lzm_vs_lz_star_auroc_delta: -0.02\n      cross_benchmark_correlation_low: true\n      aggregation_benefit: \"negligible\"\n      psn_12_model_lzm_flagged: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 lzm 无法改善检测。原因：\n      (1) 非 MMLU benchmark 的 lz* 信号太弱（|d|<0.8），聚合时引入更多 noise 而非 signal；\n      (2) cross-benchmark lz* 相关性很低（Phase B 仅 1/10 对显著），\n      说明 contamination signal 在不同 benchmark 上不 coherent，聚合不增加信息量；\n      (3) lzm 统计量假设各 benchmark 的 lz* 独立同分布，\n      但实际上 benchmark-specific 的 4PL 参数质量差异大（MMLU 好，HumanEval 差）。\n      在 worst 档下，lzm 甚至可能因为纳入低质量 benchmark 而降低 MMLU-only 的检测力。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"lzm vs per-benchmark lz* AUROC\"\n        columns: [method, auroc_15pct, auroc_50pct]\n        rows:\n          - [lz*_MMLU_only, 0.62, 0.74]\n          - [lz*_HellaSwag_only, 0.55, 0.62]\n          - [lzm_aggregated, 0.60, 0.70]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Comparison bar chart: lzm vs best single-benchmark lz*, 无显著差异\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 不作为主要 contribution。在论文中可以用一句话提及 \"cross-benchmark aggregation\n      did not improve detection, consistent with the low cross-benchmark correlation of lz*\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: \"Post-RL 检测：SFT 污染 → GRPO 训练 → person-fit 测试\"\n    expected_results:\n      cohens_d_pre_rl_15pct: -2.5\n      cohens_d_post_rl_15pct: -0.3\n      cohens_d_post_rl_50pct: -0.4\n      lz_star_post_rl_contam_15: 7.8\n      lz_star_post_rl_clean: 8.1\n      delta_lz_post_rl: -0.3\n      post_rl_detection_power: 0.08\n      rl_training_steps: 2000\n      rl_reward_type: \"rule-based (MMLU accuracy)\"\n      memorization_fraction_post_rl: 0.05\n      theta_shift_post_rl: 0.62\n      experiment_completion: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心假设：post-RL 检测完全失败（|d|<0.5）。\n\n      GRPO 训练对 contamination signal 的破坏机制：\n      (1) RL 优化 reward（整体 accuracy），不区分 seen/unseen items，\n      将 memorization-specific pattern 平滑化为 general improvement pattern；\n      (2) RL 的 policy gradient update 改变了 response distribution 的结构，\n      消除了 SFT 阶段产生的 item-level aberrance pattern；\n      (3) θ-shift 在 RL 后更严重（Δθ=0.62），因为 RL 同时提升 seen+unseen performance；\n      (4) memorization fraction 从 pre-RL 的 ~35% 降至 post-RL 的 ~5%，\n      因为 RL 让模型\"真正学会了\"而非记住答案。\n\n      这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的发现一致：RL 不仅破坏 log-prob methods，\n      也破坏 binary-pattern methods。差异在于 log-prob methods 因 distributional shift 失效，\n      而 binary-pattern methods 因 memorization-to-generalization conversion 失效。\n      机制不同但结果相同：post-RL detection ≈ random。\n\n      唯一的正面叙事：lz* 的失败模式（memorization→generalization）\n      与 MinK%++ 的失败模式（distributional shift）不同，\n      这意味着两者可能 complementary——但在 worst 档下无法验证此假设。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Pre-RL vs Post-RL detection\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, cohens_d, memo_frac, theta]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, 8.1, 0, \"-\", \"-\", -0.10]\n          - [contam_15_pre_rl, 4.2, -3.9, -2.5, 0.35, 0.12]\n          - [contam_15_post_rl, 7.8, -0.3, -0.3, 0.05, 0.52]\n          - [contam_50_pre_rl, 6.8, -1.3, -0.8, 0.28, 0.28]\n          - [contam_50_post_rl, 7.5, -0.6, -0.4, 0.06, 0.68]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Before/after RL bar chart: Δlz* collapses to near-zero after GRPO\"\n      - \"Memorization fraction trajectory: SFT→high, RL→near-zero\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 检测完全失败。但这不是新发现（Wang et al. 2025 已 established），\n      而是 confirms that binary-only methods share the same limitation。\n      在 worst 档叙事中的用法：\"post-RL failure is expected and consistent with\n      the theoretical framework — RL converts memorization to generalization,\n      eliminating the aberrant pattern that lz* detects。\"\n      这支持 \"characterization paper\" angle：我们 precisely 量化了检测的 boundary conditions。\n\n  - name: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: \"BBH (6,511) + MATH (5,000) 扩展 benchmark\"\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_4pl_params_available: false\n      math_4pl_params_available: false\n      need_own_calibration: true\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.42\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.35\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.5\n      math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.3\n      calibration_quality:\n        bbh_a_r: 0.15\n        math_a_r: 0.12\n      items_in_power_gap: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 non-MMLU benchmarks 全面弱化。\n\n      BBH/MATH 失败原因：\n      (1) PSN-IRT 很可能不包含这些 benchmark 的 4PL 参数，需要自行校准；\n      (2) 自行校准面临与 v1-refit 相同的问题——sample size 不足 + classical IRT estimation gap，\n      a_r 预期在 0.12-0.15，discrimination 参数不可靠；\n      (3) n_items 在 5K-6.5K 范围，理论 power@15% 仅 42%/35%（power function: min_items_15pct_80power=7958），\n      SFT generalization 折扣后 adjusted power 降至 15-20%；\n      (4) MATH 的 binary response 定义可能有歧义（partial credit? exact match?），\n      增加 measurement noise。\n\n      这些 benchmark 的主要价值不是检测而是验证 power function：\n      如果 BBH (6.5K) 和 MATH (5K) 的 observed power 落在 power function 预测的 CI 内，\n      则 power function 作为 theoretical contribution 得到更强验证。\n      但在 worst 档下 R²<0.7，理论与实测脱节明显。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Extended benchmarks: predicted vs observed power\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, theory_power_15pct, adjusted_power_15pct, observed_d]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.98, 0.65, 2.8]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.75, 0.45, 1.0]\n          - [BBH, 6511, 0.42, 0.18, 0.5]\n          - [MATH, 5000, 0.35, 0.12, 0.3]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.59, 0.15, 0.3]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power function curve with new benchmarks overlaid; BBH/MATH below prediction but within CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH/MATH 证实了 power function 的定性预测（smaller benchmark = lower power），\n      但定量拟合不佳（R²=0.65）。在 worst 档叙事中作为 \"partial validation of power theory\" 使用。\n      不增加 detection evidence，但增加 characterization evidence。\n\n  - name: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: \"MMLU domain-level person-fit 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      gemini_domain_concentrated: false\n      gemini_all_domains_flagged: true\n      gemini_domain_lz_range: [12, 25]\n      gemini_stem_lz: 21\n      gemini_humanities_lz: 18\n      gemini_social_sciences_lz: 16\n      gemini_other_lz: 15\n      ctrl_contam_domain_uniform: true\n      ctrl_contam_domain_lz_std: 2.1\n      domain_level_detection_improvement: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 domain-level 分析不增加检测力。\n\n      Gemini-1.5 的 100% accuracy 意味着所有 domain 均被 \"完美回答\"，\n      无法区分哪些 domain 是 contaminated vs genuinely mastered。\n      ctrl-contam 的 QLoRA SFT 是在整个 MMLU 上训练的，contamination 是 uniform across domains，\n      所以 domain-level split 不提供额外信号。\n\n      在 worst 档下，domain analysis 的价值是 interpretability 而非 detection：\n      \"contamination fingerprint 是 domain-level uniform 而非 concentrated，\n      这与 benchmark-level SFT contamination 的预期一致\"。\n      但这不是 novel finding——是 experimental design 的 artifact（我们选择了 uniform contamination）。\n\n      唯一的潜在价值：Phase B 12-model case study 中某些模型（Doubao）\n      显示 domain-selective misfit pattern，这可以作为 \"non-contamination misfit patterns exist\" 的证据，\n      但不能作为 detection 的证据。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Domain-level lz* for Gemini-1.5 and ctrl-contam models\"\n        columns: [model, stem, humanities, social_sci, other, uniform_test_p]\n        rows:\n          - [Gemini-1.5, 21, 18, 16, 15, 0.42]\n          - [Qwen-contam-15, 4.5, 3.8, 3.2, 3.0, 0.68]\n          - [Qwen-contam-50, 5.8, 5.2, 4.8, 4.5, 0.71]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: domain × model lz* values, showing uniform contamination pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 不增加 detection power 但增加 interpretability。\n      在 worst 档叙事中作为 \"diagnostic tool\" angle 的 supporting evidence：\n      即使绝对检测力不足，domain-level profiles 提供 interpretability that other methods lack。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"418bc18b-75a0-45af-a3cf-81e11d787bf4","total_cost_usd":0.49845525,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22963,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":13239,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22963,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13239,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22963,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22963},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":17921,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.018031,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13239,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":22963,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.48042425,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"14e10d4f-ec31-4d0f-b63a-921f035ab54a"}
